# Shared field PvP self-sustain: instant items first, healing agents, PvP buffs kept up, swing based weapon swap.
# Needs: hotkeys Drink Cure, Drink Heal, Drink Refresh, Drink Strength, Drink Agility, Drink Magic Resist,
#        Bandage Self, > Smart Heal/Cure Self, > Greater Heal/Cure Self, > Interrupt, Cancel Current Target.
# Bars: heal pot, reflect, and swing 1..4 (WeaponSwing type) for each enabled weapon slot.
# Turn it on when a PvP fight starts. All offense stays manual: attack spells, TK, explosion potions,
# pets, targeting and melee requests. The script never cuts a manual cast or cursor.
# No start 4 lines (conventions 02.D): a manual cursor or cast held at Play is kept.
# Arm/Dress must remove conflicting equipment.
# Design and in-game checks: blueprint/pvp.html part 5.E, blueprint/open-items.html part 10.
#
# Shape
#   Each block reads the live state and acts on the spot, the way bard-necro-enhanced and
#   lumberjack-enhanced do. No block hands a decision to a later one. Item uses go through
#   Razor's object delay queue, and every block waits while that queue is busy. A cast block
#   waits out its own cast in a for 60 poll, so the next block sees casting end.
#
# Input rules (wiki Combat Overview, blueprint/pvp.html part 5.B)
#   Potions and the pouch are instant and go out while a spell is casting.
#   Drinking with a finished precast cursor in hand cancels that spell, so a potion or a
#   bandage waits while any cursor is held. Agents and buffs need no cast and no cursor.
#   Only our own buff cast is cut, at the emergency line, so the next pass can heal.
#
# Cost (blueprint/razor.html part 6)
#   findtype is the most expensive statement. Reagents are read in REAGENTS every
#   cooldown__reagents and right after a "More reagents are needed" refusal, and the cast
#   blocks read the flags. Potions are looked up only inside a block that already needs one.

if pvp
    overhead "[ script, blocked ]" 254
    stop
endif

# ####################################################################################
# # CONFIG
# ####################################################################################
# Optional script overheads. Essential warnings remain visible.
@setvar! config__chatty 1
# Journal diagnostics: startup, agent and buff casts, weapon equip requests.
@setvar! config__sysmsg 1

# Independent features. No option overrides another.
@setvar! config__use_magery 1
@setvar! config__use_weapon 1
@setvar! config__use_bandages 1
@setvar! config__use_potions 1
@setvar! config__use_stat_potions 1
@setvar! config__use_resist_potion 1
@setvar! config__use_reactive_armor 1
@setvar! config__use_magic_reflect 1

# Missing hit points, not percent.
#   heal_hits       heal potion
#   emergency_hits  Greater Heal when no heal potion can go out, and the buff cut. Not below heal_hits
#   light_hits      light Heal when no bandage can run
@setvar! config__heal_hits 35
@setvar! config__emergency_hits 35
@setvar! config__light_hits 15
@setvar! config__refresh_stam 15

# Minimum current mana to start each spell. These do not keep a reserve: raise Greater Heal
# to 31 to always leave 20 mana for an attack or Teleport.
@setvar! config__mana_cure 6
@setvar! config__mana_greater_heal 11
@setvar! config__mana_heal 4
@setvar! config__mana_reactive_armor 4
@setvar! config__mana_magic_reflect 14

# Weapon slots. Slot N reads the "swing N" bar. Graphic 0 turns the slot off.
# A slot whose swing is ready wins, 4 down to 1. With none ready and both hands empty, the
# lowest enabled slot re-arms.
@setvar! config__weapon_1_graphic 31128
@setvar! config__weapon_2_graphic 0
@setvar! config__weapon_3_graphic 0
@setvar! config__weapon_4_graphic 31190

# ####################################################################################
# # WAIT AND COOLDOWN
# ####################################################################################
@setvar! wait__poll 100
@setvar! wait__short 200

# Debounce for repeated warnings. Without it an empty potion bag shouts every pass.
@setvar! cooldown__message 3000
# Reagent read interval. Five lookups each time. A refill in the middle of a fight counts
# within this, and running out is caught at once by the refusal line.
@setvar! cooldown__reagents 10000

# ####################################################################################
# # TIMER
# ####################################################################################
if not timerexists "timer__message"
    createtimer "timer__message"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__reagents"
    createtimer "timer__reagents"
endif

settimer "timer__message" cooldown__message
# Ready on the first pass, so reagents are read before the first cast.
settimer "timer__reagents" cooldown__reagents

# ####################################################################################
# # STATE
# ####################################################################################
# Reagent flags, written only by REAGENTS. 1 when every reagent of that spell was found.
#   Cure            garlic 3972, ginseng 3973
#   Heal            garlic, ginseng, silk 3981
#   Greater Heal    garlic, ginseng, silk, mandrake 3974
#   Reactive Armor  garlic, silk, ash 3980
#   Reflection      garlic, silk, mandrake
@setvar! var__regs_cure 0
@setvar! var__regs_heal 0
@setvar! var__regs_greater_heal 0
@setvar! var__regs_reactive_armor 0
@setvar! var__regs_magic_reflect 0
@setvar! var__has_garlic 0
@setvar! var__has_ginseng 0
@setvar! var__has_mandrake 0
@setvar! var__has_ash 0
@setvar! var__has_silk 0

# The weapon this script armed last, kept across Plays. Only own items. See WEAPON.
if not varexist var__weapon_armed_serial
    @setvar! var__weapon_armed_serial 0
endif
if not varexist var__weapon_armed_graphic
    @setvar! var__weapon_armed_graphic 0
endif

# Scratch values, each set and read inside one block only.
#   heal_potion_out  HEAL: 1 once a heal potion went out on this pass
#   weapon_want      WEAPON: slot graphic wanted on this pass, 0 for none
#   weapon_held      WEAPON: 1 when the armed serial is in a hand
@setvar! var__heal_potion_out 0
@setvar! var__weapon_want 0
@setvar! var__weapon_held 0

overhead "[ pvp, on ]" 290
if config__sysmsg = 1
    sysmsg "PvP sustain v6 loaded. Manual offense, recovery first." 88
endif

# ####################################################################################
# # MAIN LOOP
# ####################################################################################
while not dead
    if pvp
        overhead "[ script, blocked ]" 254
        stop
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # REAGENTS
    # ################################################################################
    # First in the pass, so every cast block below reads fresh flags. On the interval, or at once
    # after a refusal for reagents, so a stale flag cannot send the same doomed cast every pass.
    if config__use_magery = 1
        if timer "timer__reagents" >= cooldown__reagents or insysmsg "More reagents are needed"
            settimer "timer__reagents" 0

            @setvar! var__has_garlic 0
            @setvar! var__has_ginseng 0
            @setvar! var__has_mandrake 0
            @setvar! var__has_ash 0
            @setvar! var__has_silk 0

            if findtype 3972 self
                @setvar! var__has_garlic 1
            endif
            if findtype 3973 self
                @setvar! var__has_ginseng 1
            endif
            if findtype 3974 self
                @setvar! var__has_mandrake 1
            endif
            if findtype 3980 self
                @setvar! var__has_ash 1
            endif
            if findtype 3981 self
                @setvar! var__has_silk 1
            endif

            @setvar! var__regs_cure 0
            @setvar! var__regs_heal 0
            @setvar! var__regs_greater_heal 0
            @setvar! var__regs_reactive_armor 0
            @setvar! var__regs_magic_reflect 0

            if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_ginseng = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_cure 1
            endif
            if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_ginseng = 1 and var__has_silk = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_heal 1
            endif
            if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_ginseng = 1 and var__has_silk = 1 and var__has_mandrake = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_greater_heal 1
            endif
            if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_silk = 1 and var__has_ash = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_reactive_armor 1
            endif
            if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_silk = 1 and var__has_mandrake = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_magic_reflect 1
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # PARALYZE
    # ################################################################################
    # Nothing else can act while held, so the pouch goes out at once, as in bard-necro-enhanced.
    if paralyzed
        if findtype 3705 backpack 38
            yell "[Pouch"
            wait wait__short
        elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
            overhead "[ pouch, out ]" 254
            settimer "timer__message" 0
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # CURE
    # ################################################################################
    # Potion first, it is instant and has no cooldown, and it goes out during a cast. While any
    # cure potion is carried the agent is not used, so mana stays for Greater Heal.
    if poisoned and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists
        if config__use_potions = 1 and findtype "Orange Potion" self
            hotkey "Drink Cure"
            wait wait__short
        else
            if config__use_potions = 1 and timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ cure pot, out ]" 254
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif

            if config__use_magery = 1 and var__regs_cure = 1 and mana >= config__mana_cure and not casting
                hotkey "> Smart Heal/Cure Self"
                if config__sysmsg = 1
                    sysmsg "Agent: Smart Heal/Cure Self for poison." 88
                endif
                wait wait__short

                for 60
                    if not casting
                        break
                    endif
                    if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                        break
                    endif
                    wait wait__poll
                endfor
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # HEAL
    # ################################################################################
    # Heavy damage drinks first, because the potion is instant and goes out during a cast.
    # Greater Heal follows when no potion went out on this pass and the loss is at the
    # emergency line: none carried, on its own cooldown, or the bar still running.
    # The bar skips the label read while it runs. The label stays authoritative when the bar
    # is missing.
    if not poisoned and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists and diffhits >= config__heal_hits
        @setvar! var__heal_potion_out 0
        if config__use_potions = 1 and cooldown "heal pot" = 0
            if findtype "Yellow Potion" self as alias__heal_potion
                getlabel alias__heal_potion label__heal_potion
                if "next usable" in label__heal_potion
                    # Still on its own cooldown.
                else
                    hotkey "Drink Heal"
                    @setvar! var__heal_potion_out 1
                    wait wait__short
                endif
            elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ heal pot, out ]" 254
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif
        endif

        if var__heal_potion_out = 0 and diffhits >= config__emergency_hits and config__use_magery = 1 and var__regs_greater_heal = 1 and mana >= config__mana_greater_heal and not casting
            hotkey "> Greater Heal/Cure Self"
            if config__sysmsg = 1
                sysmsg "Agent: Greater Heal/Cure Self." 88
            endif
            wait wait__short

            for 60
                if not casting
                    break
                endif
                if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                    break
                endif
                wait wait__poll
            endfor

            # The agent leaves its beneficial cursor up when there is nothing left to heal.
            if targetexists "beneficial" and diffhits = 0
                hotkey "Cancel Current Target"
                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # BANDAGE
    # ################################################################################
    # Never restarts a running bandage, and full health does not start one. Its target cursor
    # would replace a held precast, so it waits while any cursor is up.
    if config__use_bandages = 1 and not bandaging and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists and skill "Healing" > 0
        if diffhits > 0 or poisoned
            if findtype 3617 self
                hotkey "Bandage Self"
                wait wait__short
            elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ bandage, out ]" 254
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # LIGHT HEAL
    # ################################################################################
    # Only when no bandage can run: bandages off, no Healing, or none left.
    if not poisoned and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists and not bandaging and config__use_magery = 1 and var__regs_heal = 1 and diffhits >= config__light_hits and mana >= config__mana_heal
        if config__use_bandages = 0 or skill "Healing" = 0 or not findtype 3617 self
            hotkey "> Smart Heal/Cure Self"
            if config__sysmsg = 1
                sysmsg "Agent: Smart Heal/Cure Self, no bandage." 88
            endif
            wait wait__short

            for 60
                if not casting
                    break
                endif
                if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                    break
                endif
                wait wait__poll
            endfor

            if targetexists "beneficial" and diffhits = 0
                hotkey "Cancel Current Target"
                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # REFRESH
    # ################################################################################
    if stam <= config__refresh_stam and config__use_potions = 1 and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists
        if findtype "Red Potion" self
            hotkey "Drink Refresh"
            wait wait__short
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # STAT POTIONS
    # ################################################################################
    # Kept up for the whole fight: a missing buff is drunk at once. findbuff matches part of a
    # name, so "Strength" also sees the Strength Potion Usage Cooldown icon, which is exactly
    # when the potion could not go out anyway. The potion is looked up only for a missing buff.
    # Each buff is judged on its own, so running out of one potion does not hold up the others.
    if config__use_potions = 1 and config__use_stat_potions = 1 and not paralyzed and not hidden and not targetexists
        if not queued and not findbuff "Strength"
            if findtype "White Potion" self
                hotkey "Drink Strength"
                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
        if not queued and not findbuff "Agility"
            if findtype "Blue Potion" self
                hotkey "Drink Agility"
                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
        if config__use_resist_potion = 1 and not queued and not findbuff "Magic Resist Potion"
            if findtype "Black Potion" self
                hotkey "Drink Magic Resist"
                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # SELF BUFFS
    # ################################################################################
    # Reactive Armor, then Magic Reflection, whenever one is missing and the window is free.
    # No walk guard: in a fight there is no better moment to wait for. Not started at the
    # emergency line, and cut there mid cast so the next pass can heal. The reflect bar is
    # the server's recast lock after Reflect is used up.
    if config__use_magery = 1 and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists and diffhits < config__emergency_hits
        if config__use_reactive_armor = 1 and var__regs_reactive_armor = 1 and mana >= config__mana_reactive_armor and not findbuff "Reactive Armor"
            cast "Reactive Armor"
            if config__sysmsg = 1
                sysmsg "Buff: Reactive Armor." 88
            endif
            wait wait__short

            for 60
                if not casting
                    break
                endif
                if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                    break
                endif
                if diffhits >= config__emergency_hits
                    hotkey "> Interrupt"
                    break
                endif
                wait wait__poll
            endfor
        elseif config__use_magic_reflect = 1 and var__regs_magic_reflect = 1 and mana >= config__mana_magic_reflect and cooldown "reflect" = 0 and not findbuff "Magic Reflection"
            cast "Magic Reflection"
            if config__sysmsg = 1
                sysmsg "Buff: Magic Reflection." 88
            endif
            wait wait__short

            for 60
                if not casting
                    break
                endif
                if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                    break
                endif
                if diffhits >= config__emergency_hits
                    hotkey "> Interrupt"
                    break
                endif
                wait wait__poll
            endfor
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # WEAPON
    # ################################################################################
    # Wanted slot: the highest enabled slot whose swing bar is ready, 4 down to 1. With none
    # ready and both hands empty, the lowest enabled slot. A missing bar reads ready.
    # The armed serial is searched only when the wanted slot changes, so a steady pass costs two
    # hand reads. A weapon already in hand is adopted without a request. Arming during a cast
    # would interrupt it (wiki Combat Overview), so this waits for a free window.
    # The equip request is not proof of a swing.
    if config__use_weapon = 1 and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
        @setvar! var__weapon_want 0
        if config__weapon_4_graphic != 0 and cooldown "swing 4" = 0
            @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_4_graphic
        elseif config__weapon_3_graphic != 0 and cooldown "swing 3" = 0
            @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_3_graphic
        elseif config__weapon_2_graphic != 0 and cooldown "swing 2" = 0
            @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_2_graphic
        elseif config__weapon_1_graphic != 0 and cooldown "swing 1" = 0
            @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_1_graphic
        elseif lhandempty and rhandempty
            if config__weapon_1_graphic != 0
                @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_1_graphic
            elseif config__weapon_2_graphic != 0
                @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_2_graphic
            elseif config__weapon_3_graphic != 0
                @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_3_graphic
            elseif config__weapon_4_graphic != 0
                @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_4_graphic
            endif
        endif

        if var__weapon_want != 0
            if var__weapon_armed_graphic != var__weapon_want
                @setvar! var__weapon_armed_graphic var__weapon_want
                @setvar! var__weapon_armed_serial 0
                if findtype var__weapon_want self as alias__own_weapon
                    @setvar! var__weapon_armed_serial alias__own_weapon
                endif
            endif

            @setvar! var__weapon_held 0
            if findlayer self lefthand as alias__held_left
                if alias__held_left = var__weapon_armed_serial
                    @setvar! var__weapon_held 1
                endif
            endif
            if findlayer self righthand as alias__held_right
                if alias__held_right = var__weapon_armed_serial
                    @setvar! var__weapon_held 1
                endif
            endif

            if var__weapon_held = 0
                if find var__weapon_armed_serial backpack
                    dress var__weapon_armed_serial
                    if config__sysmsg = 1
                        sysmsg "PvP weapon: equip requested, graphic={{var__weapon_want}}, serial={{var__weapon_armed_serial}}." 88
                    endif
                    wait wait__short
                else
                    # Gone from hand and pack: search again next pass.
                    @setvar! var__weapon_armed_graphic 0
                    if lhandempty and rhandempty and timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                        overhead "[ weapon, out ]" 254
                        settimer "timer__message" 0
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    wait wait__poll
endwhile
